  (text "Block 6: Keypad\n\n- Proposed (to be justified in Stage 2): I2C keypad scanner IC with interrupt line to CM5,\n  mainline Linux driver, no firmware. Alternative: small MCU as USB HID keyboard.\n\nOPEN: key count and switch type" (at 20 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 4f300489-0bbf-4f09-b829-0027c9fff159))
